message: >-
  If you use this software, cite the archived software release and the
  associated paper when available.
type: software
title: >-
  Polymer Specimen Vision System: Reproducible D405 and YOLO Material-Level
  Measurement
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Abd Al Kader
    given-names: Mostafa
  - family-names: Hernández-del-Valle
