abstract: >-
  A research software system for synchronized laboratory acquisition,
  Intel RealSense D405 bulk-volume reconstruction, offline YOLO segmentation,
  method-neutral experiment records, and traceable measurement analysis.
keywords:
  - polymer
  - material level
  - Intel RealSense D405
  - YOLO segmentation
  - depth reconstruction
  - reproducible research
